    "text": "News\nFoundations of Cybersecurity 1\nBen Stock\nNews\nList news\nChange in tutorials: update your preferences\nWritten on 13.10.2026 16:49 \t\t\tby Nicolas Gundall\nDear all,\nwe've been notified that the tutorial we scheduled on\nFridays 10-12\ncollides with the MfI1 lecture for many students. Tutorial preferences also indicated that very few students could attend this slot. Consequently, we have decided to\nmove this tutorial to Mondays 12-14 instead\n.\nPlease make sure to update the tutorial preferences on your personal status page accordingly. You can adjust your preferences until the end of this Thursday's lecture.\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nLegal Notice\nIf you encounter technical problems, please contact\nthe administrators\n.",
