    "title": "News",
    "text": "News\nFoundations of Cybersecurity 1\nBen Stock\nNews\nList news\nUpdate on tutorials and exercises\nWritten on 22.10.2026 13:09 \t\t\tby Nicolas Gundall\nDear all,\nSince today's lecture is cancelled, we are missing the main content that would normally be discussed in the tutorials. We will thus convert the next set of tutorials (23.10. and 26.10) into office hours. This means that no new content will be presented; instead you are welcome to ask your tutor questions about the course contents so far. If you do not have any questions, you do not need to attend. If you choose to come to an office hour, please arrive at the regular starting time, because the tutors may leave early in case all questions are answered.\nFurthermore, we have to make some adjustments to the scheduling of exercise sheets and python tasks. To prevent confusion, here is the current release schedule:\nWeek\nNew python tasks? (Tuesdays)\nNew exercise sheet? (Thursdays)\n19.10. to 25.10. (current)\n✅️\n❌️\n26.10. to 1.11.\n✅️\n✅️\n2.11. to 8.11.\n✅️\n✅️\n9.11. to 15.11.\n✅️\n✅️\n16.11. to 22.11.\n❌️\n✅️\nFrom then on\n✅️\n✅️\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nLegal Notice\nIf you encounter technical problems, please contact\nthe administrators\n.",
