    "url": "https://muandet-lab.github.io/ipml-course/2026-2027/",
    "final_url": "https://muandet-lab.github.io/ipml-course/2026-2027/",
    "title": " Winter Semester 2026/27 - Imprecise Probabilistic Machine Learning / Winter Semester 2026/27 ",
    "key": "53588428dcc9a6fe",
    "text": "Winter Semester 2026/27 - Imprecise Probabilistic Machine Learning / Winter Semester 2026/27\nCISPA Helmholtz Center for Information Security\nImprecise Probabilistic Machine Learning\nWinter Semester 2026/27\nMain Navigation\nHome\nOverview\nSchedule\nLectures\nExercises\nReferences\nPast Offerings\nImprecise Probabilistic Machine Learning\n/ Winter Semester 2026/27\nUpdates\n[23.10.2026]\nNew lecture is up: Lecture 2: From Precise to Imprecise Probabilities\n                [\nslides\n]\n[16.10.2026]\nNew lecture is up: Lecture 1: Introduction\n                [\nslides\n]\n[25.09.2026]\nThe Google group for the Winter Semester 2026/27 is now\nlive\n. Click\nAsk to\njoin\nto request access.\n[20.09.2026]\nThe\nschedule\nfor Winter Semester\n2026/27 is now online.\n[20.09.2026]\nWelcome to the IPML course website!\nLogistics\nLecture\nFriday, 10 a.m. – 12 p.m.\nExercise\nFriday, 12 p.m. – 2 p.m.\nLocation\nSaarland University (UdS) - CISPA C0 - 0.05 Lecture Hall\nUniversity of Hamburg (UHH) - Seminar Room 1.8, Haus der Informatik, Bundesstraße 56b\nOnline\nFormat\nWeekly lectures with biweekly in-class exercises and assignments\nDiscussion\nGoogle Group\nExam dates\nUdS (Feb 26, 2027, 09:00-12:00, Geb. E1.3: HS001 & Mar 19, 2027, 09:00-12:00, Geb. E1.3: HS001)\nUHH (Feb 18, 2027, 12:00-15:00, Hörsaal 5 & Mar 23, 2027, 12:00-15:00, Hörsaal 5)\nRegistration\nAll students are encouraged to register via this\nregistration link\nto receive the Zoom link and join our Google Group,\nipml-course-ws-2026-2027\n, to receive course news, updates, and announcements. Click\nAsk to join\nto request access to the group.\nStudents at Saarland University and the University of Hamburg\nmust officially enroll in the course at their respective universities to receive credits\n. Students from other universities are welcome to participate through our public enrollment.\nCourse Material\nSchedule\n— lecture and exercise dates\nLectures\n— planned topics; slides are posted as the semester progresses\nExercises\n— worksheets are released during the semester\nReading material that is not specific to a single semester is collected on the\nreferences\npage. Slides from the\nprevious offering\nremain available.\nInstructor\nKrikamol Muandet\nCISPA Helmholtz Center for Information Security\nTeaching Assistants\nAnurag Singh\nCISPA Helmholtz Center for Information Security\nKiet Vo\nCISPA Helmholtz Center for Information Security\nGowtham Reddy\nCISPA Helmholtz Center for Information Security\nYuhao Wang\nAmazon\nRational Intelligence Lab\nCISPA Helmholtz Center for Information Security\nSaarbrücken, Germany\nri-lab.org/",
